A||N||4||silverfreak||I love my fiero, but i wish it had a/c. ||||5||
Z||000000||silverfreak||05-23-2000||03:33 AM||||I found my fiero about 6 months ago. My car is in exellent condition. I have not had any problems with it due to the previous owners pampering of my new baby. She has 72000 miles. But now that summer is approaching, I wish that it had A/C. Is there an aftermarket A/C kit available? Any suggestions short of selling my awesome new toy?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Carrolles||05-23-2000||07:43 AM||||I believe you'll need a Fiero A/C system.  The compressor brackets are unique to the Fiero.  I'm not sure if the ECM is different for a/c vs. non-a/c cars.  The ecm does control engine idle speed about a half second prior to engaging the a/c clutch to help keep idle speed constant.<P>Contact Ed Parks at the Fiero Factory in Huntsville, AL. at:<P>(256) 420-5391<BR>Fierofactory@juno.com<P>He can probably help you out.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
Z||000002||Carrolles||05-23-2000||07:44 AM||||I believe you'll need a Fiero A/C system.  The compressor brackets are unique to the Fiero.  I'm not sure if the ECM is different for a/c vs. non-a/c cars.  The ecm does control engine idle speed about a half second prior to engaging the a/c clutch to help keep idle speed constant.<P>Contact Ed Parks at the Fiero Factory in Huntsville, AL. at:<P>(256) 420-5391<BR>Fierofactory@juno.com<P>He can probably help you out.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
Z||000003||Greg Piet||05-23-2000||01:59 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>if you want ill trade you all my AC stuff for a RSM motorsports supercharger kit!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Denise||05-24-2000||12:08 PM||||SilverFreak, you can put the ac in the car. but it is a big job! if you are serious you can get all the parts.  what engine do you have?  We did mine when we put the car back together. went through 3 compressors till we found one that works.  (used parts, gotta love it!)  Mine did have ac though. the lines are long and under the car. very difficult for a backyard mechanic to do. I'm running R12 in mine. (i'm an AC contractor) EPA Class 4 too. (no I don't do other cars!)  good luck! ||||reg||1
